-- title:
--   From HTo GAdjacent Stage M2 Pointwise Half Sandwich Right Shape
-- statement:
--   **The pointwise M2 stage factors through a right half-sandwich.** For the same fixed stage variables, the filtered M2 expression with `T U T`-order on the left becomes an unrestricted sum with the outcome and half-product grouped before the adjoint factor:
--
--   $$
--   \sum_{g,gs}^{\mathrm{filtered}}
--   \operatorname{ev}_{\psi_{bi}}\!\left(L(TUT^{\dagger})R(SU)\right)
--   =
--   \sum_{g,gs}
--   \operatorname{ev}_{\psi_{bi}}\!\left(L(TU)\bigl(L(T^{\dagger})R(SU)\bigr)\right).
--   $$
--
--   The equality is a pointwise reindexing over the Boolean outcome type and G-hat type classes followed by the half-sandwich operator identity. It supplies the matching right-shape expression used for the next adjacent-stage comparison.
--
--   Formalization credit: Sirui Lu, Ruixuan Deng, Yanqiao Zhu, and Zhengfeng Ji (arXiv:2609.19814). Mathematical source: Zhengfeng Ji, Anand Natarajan, Thomas Vidick, John Wright, and Henry Yuen (arXiv:2009.12982).
--
--   **Formalization Note.** The source declaration is `MIPStarRE.LDT.Pasting.fromHToGAdjacentStageM2_pointwise_halfSandwichRightShape`; its Lean statement gives the exact quantifier order and all boundary hypotheses.
